fix(ui,tray,i18n): address 11 UX/visual defects and add ES/EN localization

Resolve all 11 user-reported visual/UX issues and default Spanish localization:
1. Render sticky-64x64.png at 34x34 in the deployed bar.
2. Expand DockBarMetrics (BarActionPadding=118) so the '+' button is never clipped.
3. Collapse TabBorder while DockState.Expanded so tab/chevron does not overlap the bar.
4-5. Compute dynamic ribbon thickness from item count, align RibbonPanel flush against ContentPanel with zero adjacent gap to stop lateral jumps.
6-7. Use ContentControl + DataTemplate inside RibbonPanel so repeated ribbon toggles always render ShortcutItems cleanly.
8-9. Handle IsVisibleChanged in PointerRegionBehavior to prevent stuck hover regions.
10. Embed icons/sticky.ico as ApplicationIcon, load it in Win32TrayIconService, and enforce single-instance via Mutex (Local\StickyDock.SingleInstance).
11. Position tray context menu with GetPhysicalCursorPos instead of GetMessagePos.
- Add LocalizedStrings (default Spanish "es", configurable to English "en") with v5->v6 schema migration (AddLanguageMigration) and live tray/settings/bar updates.
- Builds Debug/Release clean (0 errors/warnings); 492/492 tests passing.

Refs: RF02, RF03, RF04, E4-CA1, E5-CA1, E6-CA1, E6-CA2, E6-CA3